# docs/READING-THE-RECORD.md.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Engineering Reliability: four demonstrations of engineering decisions in health data and AI agent systems"
abstract: >-
  Four small, deterministic demonstrations from The Real Cat Labs. Registry Metric Lab shows how a
  site join inflates trial enrollment. Continuity Ledger separates remembered instructions from
  current permission. Adapter Promotion Gate binds a model change to exact evidence before it can
  serve. Stagnation Observatory checks agent progress against verified milestones and shows where
  that check raises false alerts. Each demo has its own tests, an offline report, and comment claims
  enforced by mutation tests.
